{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/202663Ynr2n9yv1795260616.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>港超，傑志2-1擊敗大埔。</p><p></p><p>白衫的傑志30分鐘領先，祖連奴接應傳中頂入，1-0亦是半場比數。大埔換邊後一度追平，華力臣近門加一腳，76分鐘射成1-1，只是未能維持到尾。補時輸十二碼，馬昆奴斯解圍，踢中奧比達頭部，艾華頓操刀，補時1分鐘射入，個人交出一入球一助攻，為傑志鎖定贏2-1，今季聯賽繼續不敗，排第二。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:44:01.558289+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T21:31:59.967826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T12:37:17.232440+00:00","content_hash":"946f3eeef552d44b4a093baf266b46dc2d034b60733cd04fb9ef15ede91640de","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T12:44:01.558289+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}